# Compile the native better-sqlite3 addon from source instead of downloading
# a prebuild-install prebuilt binary. Applies to every `npm ci`/`npm install`
# in this repo -- contributor machines, CI, and release builds alike. See
# docs/adr/0016-native-dependency-install-policy-by-environment.md for the
# rationale (avoids depending on prebuild-install's continued operation; that
# package is deprecated upstream with no maintained successor). Requires a
# C/C++ toolchain (see README.md prerequisites). This never affects end users:
# published release archives bundle the already-built native addon and never
# run npm install on the end-user machine.
build-from-source=true
